## Overview

This PR adds an NVIDIA-developed specialized decode for MiniMax-M3.1-Flash on GB300, for the small decode batches that agentic and interactive serving run. It supports:
- one GB300 tray at TP4 (GB200 / B200 also run it);
- no speculation, or DSpark speculative decoding with up to 7 draft tokens;
- FULL-graph decode steps of up to 64 rows (8 requests × (K + 1) tokens). Prefill, mixed batches and larger batches fall back to the stock forward.

